@MohitAMD Please note: there is an RDMA CI coverage with AMD. It is part of .buildkite/amd-disagg/pipeline-disagg.yaml which runs various models on an MI355 + AINIC. So the statement of no CI coverage in description is wrong - seems like AI generated content. Since this uses GLM 5.3 FP8 a similar path for GLM 5.2 FP8 is avaialble which might get affected. 

Please reach out offline if you need to run on a specific PR. 

cc: @dllehr-amd @chunfangamd @ChuanLi1101

